    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730462099452\" id=\"item-6724bcb615b5a75ecb61a141\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-1ba065d448de040f3319\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us: </strong>PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Five Generously Sized Bedrooms</strong>: Each bedroom is designed to be a peaceful retreat, ideal for relaxation and privacy, with plenty of space for the entire family or guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Modern Bathrooms</strong>: Featuring quality fixtures and a contemporary aesthetic, the bathrooms are designed for comfort and convenience, making daily routines a pleasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Expansive Living Area</strong>: The open-plan living room is the heart of the home, providing a welcoming space for family gatherings or entertaining, with large windows bringing in natural light and scenic views.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Well-Appointed Kitchen</strong>: The spacious kitchen boasts modern appliances, ample storage, and a functional layout, ideal for both everyday meals and special occasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage</strong>: The secure garage provides convenient parking and additional storage options, perfect for keeping vehicles and belongings safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living Spaces</strong>: Enjoy a beautifully landscaped yard that offers both relaxation and entertainment areas, perfect for BBQs, family gatherings, or simply soaking in the tranquil surroundings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Constructed with attention to detail and quality, 7 Neherana Place perfectly combines modern comfort and family-friendly design. Located in a peaceful yet accessible area of Taradale, this home is ideal for those seeking a serene lifestyle with all the conveniences close at hand. Don\u2019t miss the opportunity to make this spacious family retreat your own.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6724bf06020fc43e4cbc3888&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6724bf06020fc43e4cbc3888&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730450057056_145618\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class